WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.700 --> 00:00:09.400
Review transfer requests
Administrators review requests to move learning progress from the old LMS into new modules. Pending and Approved separate requests by status.

2
00:00:09.400 --> 00:00:16.800
Find a request
Search the retrieved requests, filter by programme and change the sort order. Use pagination and retrieval controls when more requests are available.

3
00:00:16.800 --> 00:00:26.100
Check component matching
Review transfer opens the old and new module components. Move between weeks and check the proposed matches. Review existing completions before making changes.

4
00:00:26.100 --> 00:00:33.600
Approve a transfer
Approve transfer applies the reviewed mappings. Check the learner and module carefully. Cancel closes the review without approving the request.

5
00:00:33.600 --> 00:00:44.448
Check history and refresh
Approved shows completed requests. Export log downloads the transfer log. Refresh retrieves current requests; use Retry refresh if the service fails.
